@title 3D vents: a grille that is too small is said so and the proposal brings its own
@area 3D
@sizes 1366x768 1920x1080
# The hot cabinet already holds one 30 x 30 mm grille (fixture made by qa/fixtures/make_vents_fixtures.py). It is no way out for the proposed filter fan, so the card says so and offers the fan with a grille of its own on top. The run is finished before the shot.
open qa/fixtures/cabinet-vents-small-grille.novo
wait 20
click_text 3D #1
wait 30
click_text Heat #1
wait 20
click_text "Settings for the next run"
wait 10
click_text Quick
wait 10
click_text Simulate #2
wait_s 150
expect_not "Locked while the run goes"
expect "Cooling selection proposes"
expect "A grille of about"
expect "smaller than this flow needs"
shot 01-small-grille-card
check_layout
check_blank 01-small-grille-card
